{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@4008","endTime":354911.385,"result":{"value":"All projects\nMOBILE EXPERIENCE / 04\nSilasync.\n\nA logistics-oriented mobile workspace presenting shipment records, company information, freight imagery, and account entry.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nMobile apps\nFOCUS\nLogistics & shipment records\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nBring shipment information into focus.\n\nSilasync’s supplied screens introduce a freight-oriented workspace through truck imagery, company views, and structured shipment records. Location and shipment information sit within compact operational layouts. The recognizable green identity connects these detailed screens with the simpler welcome and sign-in presentation.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in Silasync's original project material.\n\n01\nDashboard modules\n\nCards group summary information within a mobile home view.\n\n02\nStructured records\n\nList-based screens organize individual information entries.\n\n03\nForm layouts\n\nLabeled inputs provide a dedicated information-entry pattern.\n\n04\nStatus treatments\n\nColored labels distinguish information within the records.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nLogistics & shipment records\n\nBright green headers and controls bring consistency to otherwise light screens. White cards, compact labels, and contrasting status colors divide dense information into smaller groups, helping the mobile layouts retain a clear visual order.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside Silasync.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n01\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n02\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n03\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n04\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT MOBILE PROJECT\nDigital Habit Tracker\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nHABITS & ROUTINES\nDigital Habit Tracker\nTEAM COMMUNICATION\nTukeeConnect\nGOLF & COURSE ACTIVITY\nPace of Play\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
